dev-no-redoxer = redoxer is required: cargo install redoxer --locked && redoxer toolchain
dev-no-reader = the reader { $device } is not connected
dev-no-access = no write access to { $node }: install scripts/70-redox-passthrough.rules for the session and remove it afterwards, it gives every program in your session direct access to the reader
dev-no-docker = docker is required
